41346::$$$message_0277_0000_0000$$$::"That is good. The gods were watching over your daily good deeds."::
41347::$$$message_0277_0001_0000$$$::"Apparently there are eight million gods in this country. I also wish for you to receive their divine protection.[br][cacheimage storage=セイバー巫女服01f(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー巫女服01f(中)]Then, as the priestess instructed..."::
41348::$$$message_0277_0002_0000$$$::"I speak this prayer humbly and reverently."[wm canskip=0]::

